Subject: [M150] Ensure stopped transceivers do not hold a channel

Original change's description:
> Ensure stopped transceivers do not hold a channel
>
> Make sure that a transceiver that has been stopped does not get a
> channel during negotiation, and that any channel is cleared before a
> stopped transceiver is removed from the transceiver list.
>
